  "notes": "2-channel compressor/limiter/gate (19\" rack, IEC mains). Per channel: balanced inputs and outputs on XLR and 6.35 mm TRS (the two output connectors are wired in parallel). Unbalanced 6.35 mm SIDECHAIN SEND and RETURN per channel (the return is a control input, not part of the audio path); hard bypass links input to output when the channel is OUT or unpowered. OPERATING LEVEL switch: -10 dBV or +4 dBu. XLR genders follow the usual convention (not stated). Controls from the Quick Start Guide, 'Controls' (1-32), per channel: expander/gate (TRIGGER, RELEASE short/long, GATE), compressor (THRESHOLD, RATIO, LO CONTOUR, INTERACT KNEE, AUTO, ATTACK, RELEASE, SC EXT, SC MON, TUBE), OUTPUT (+/-20 dB), IN/OUT METER, IN/OUT (hard bypass), de-esser (LEVEL, MALE, IN/OUT), LIMITER (fully right = off), OPERATING LEVEL (+4 dBu / -10 dBV, rear) and COUPLE (stereo link). Modelled: SC MON puts the SIDECHAIN RETURN signal on the output and mutes the input signal. The guide describes one channel; all channels are taken to be identical. Start positions are app defaults.",
